## Readiness / reconciliation / realtime start regenerate the session-only R2RML first
================================================================================

Context: the first run of the live incremental journey (scenario 06, below)
against the sandbox app reported `sources: []`, `mappings: []`, `compile_error:
""` for a domain with a saved row-local mapping. The R2RML is session-only
(`DomainSession.generated["r2rml"]`, not persisted with the domain): every build
and query path calls `ensure_generated_content()` to regenerate it from the
saved mappings before reading it, but `TwinIncrementalBuild.mappings_for` — the
derivation the readiness preflight, the slot reconciliation and the `realtime`
start share — read `get_r2rml()` directly, so a domain opened from the registry
(the normal way a user reaches the Domain page's readiness card) looked unmapped
to all three. The scheduled tick was unaffected (`TaskContext` ensures first).

Changes:

1. src/back/objects/digitaltwin/build/TwinIncrementalBuild.py — `mappings_for`
   calls `ensure_generated_content()` when the domain has it (test doubles
   without it still work), then reads the R2RML; docstring says why.
2. tests/units/objects/test_mappings_for.py — a registry-opened domain (saved
   mappings, empty R2RML until regenerated) yields its mappings.
3. tests/e2e/scenarios/test_scenario_06_incremental_live.py (new, opt-in
   `scenario` marker, `ONTOBRICKS_SCENARIO_LIVE=1`) — the deterministic
   incremental journey on a deployed app: Lakehouse domain in `incremental`
   mode over a row-tracked table, one-class ontology, row-local mapping,
   `/mapping/generate`, readiness (sources, per-mapping class, decision,
   `lakehouse_rt`, `read_relation`), optional untracked source +
   `enable-row-tracking`, the Domain page readiness card (screenshot),
   `/dtwin/sync/start` polled to completion, `/dtwin/incremental/status`,
   `/domain/build-runs` trace facts, `/dtwin/incremental/overview`, the Query
   page status card (screenshot). Env: `ONTOBRICKS_SCENARIO_CATALOG/SCHEMA`,
   `ONTOBRICKS_SCENARIO6_TABLE`, `ONTOBRICKS_SCENARIO6_UNTRACKED`,
   `ONTOBRICKS_SCENARIO6_BUILD_TIMEOUT`.
4. docs/incremental-materialization.md — Readiness preflight: the derivation
   regenerates the session-only R2RML first.

